The derived products in this repository (surface-reflectance composites on the
50 m working grid, RGB composites, and the 5-class / 6-class reference maps) are
released under CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Attribution of upstream sources:
- Landsat-8 imagery courtesy of the U.S. Geological Survey (public domain).
- Reference maps derived from ESA WorldCover 2021 v200 (CC BY 4.0), Zanaga et al.
  2022, doi:10.5281/zenodo.7254221. Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data
  (2021) processed by the ESA WorldCover consortium.
